{"id":"5349915a17c515d9","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-revision-convergence.md","title":"序列稳定与跨初值稳定的区别","display":"thm-revision-convergence — 序列稳定与跨初值稳定的区别","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-revision-convergence","aliases":["91-thm-revision-convergence","91-thm-revision-stability","91-thm-Gupta-convergence"],"display":"thm-revision-convergence — 序列稳定与跨初值稳定的区别","depends_on":["[[91-df-revision-theory]]","[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-teller]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-revision-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-revision-convergence</span><span>91-thm-revision-stability</span><span>91-thm-Gupta-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-revision-convergence — 序列稳定与跨初值稳定的区别"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" href=\"?note=7d3a4c127d0fc0fb\" title=\"91-df-revision-theory\">91-df-revision-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0^{\\mathcal H},v_1^{\\mathcal H},\\ldots\">\\(v_0^{\\mathcal H},v_1^{\\mathcal H},\\ldots\\)</span> (从初始假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 生成的修正序列)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqStable}_{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqStable}_{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (在该序列上最终常值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CatStable}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{CatStable}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (所有允许初值最终取得同一值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n的真理陈述者)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}revision\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SeqStable}_{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\,\n\\forall n\\geq N\\,\n\\bigl(v_n^{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)=c\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}revision\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SeqStable}_{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\,\n\\forall n\\geq N\\,\n\\bigl(v_n^{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)=c\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对真理陈述者，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathcal H\\,\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\nv_{n+1}^{\\mathcal H}(\\tau)=v_n^{\\mathcal H}(\\tau)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathcal H\\,\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\nv_{n+1}^{\\mathcal H}(\\tau)=v_n^{\\mathcal H}(\\tau)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>真理陈述者在一步修正规则下复制自己的前一值，所以对每个固定初值都\n立即稳定；不同初值却可给出不同稳定值。它是序列稳定但非必然\ncategorically stable 的典型，而不是“在任意初值下永远振荡”。</p>\n<p>修正理论还需规定极限阶段规则。没有这些细节，不能宣称所有稳定句在\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{CK}\">\\(\\omega_1^{CK}\\)</span> 前有统一收敛界，也不能把“所有修正序列\n最终为真”的集合无条件等同于 Kripke 极小固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-revision-theory","status":"resolved","id":"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-revision-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v_0^{\\mathcal H},v_1^{\\mathcal H},\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeqStable}_{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CatStable}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}revision\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SeqStable}_{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\,\n\\forall n\\geq N\\,\n\\bigl(v_n^{\\mathcal H}(\\varphi)=c\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathcal H\\,\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\nv_{n+1}^{\\mathcal H}(\\tau)=v_n^{\\mathcal H}(\\tau)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1^{CK}","display":false}],"bytes":1740,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-str